    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54829" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατα-πλαστός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>plastered over</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρμακον καταπλαστόν,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάπλασμα</span>
			, <i>plaster</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				717
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χριστά</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτά</span>, v. Sch.ad loc.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
			<i>affected</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαμφιεῖ τὸ κ. σου ἡ
